<title>USA: United Industrial wins $35 mln contract.</title>
<headline>United Industrial wins $35 mln contract.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>United Industrial Corp has received a $35 million contract to upgrade maintenance training devices (MTDs) for the U.S. Air Force's C-17 aircraft.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it will modify two suites of C-17 training devices to reflect changes that have been made in the aircraft, determine what improvements could be made to cut costs in the maintenance training program and provide logistics support for the two suites.</p>
</text>
